# Performance

## Budgets

- Lighthouse Perf / A11y / BP / SEO **> 90**
- LCP ≤ 2.5s → **poster/image**, never video/WebGL
- CLS ≤ 0.1
- Home first paint: no Three, no YouTube iframe

## Media pipeline

```text
IO / in-view → lazy load → optional preload next → pause/dispose offscreen
```

- Never load all videos/textures at once
- Trailer = click-to-load facade
- `next/image` + correct `sizes`
- Cap Three DPR; dispose on unmount
- Constants: `src/constants/performance.ts`

Do not run production builds unless the user asks.
